@startuml sequence-success-flow
title Saga Orquestrada – Fluxo de Sucesso (Happy Path)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 14
skinparam BoxPadding 6
autonumber "<b>[00]"

actor Cliente as C
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "Order\nService" as OS #EAF2FB
participant "Saga\nOrchestrator" as ORC #F3EAF8
participant "Inventory\nService" as IS #E6F4EA
participant "Payment\nService" as PS #FFF6D6
participant "Gateway de\nPagamento (ext.)" as PG #EEEEEE

C -> GW : POST /orders {itens, pagamento}\nIdempotency-Key: K1
GW -> OS : POST /orders
activate OS
OS -> OS : <b>TX local</b>: INSERT order(status=PENDING)\n+ INSERT outbox(OrderCreated)
OS --> GW : 202 Accepted {orderId, status=PENDING}
GW --> C : 202 Accepted (acompanhar via GET /orders/{id})
OS ->> ORC : «event» OrderCreated {orderId, saga_id}\n(Outbox relay → broker)
deactivate OS

activate ORC
ORC -> ORC : <b>TX local</b>: INSERT saga_instance(STARTED→STOCK_RESERVING)\n+ saga_step(deadline) + outbox(ReserveStock)
ORC ->> IS : «command» ReserveStock {saga_id, orderId, itens, ttl=15min}
deactivate ORC

activate IS
IS -> IS : <b>TX local</b>: dedup(message_id) + UPDATE stock (disponível − qtd)\n+ INSERT reservation(RESERVED, expires_at) + outbox(StockReserved)
IS ->> ORC : «reply» StockReserved {reservationId}
deactivate IS

activate ORC
ORC -> ORC : <b>TX local</b>: estado → PAYMENT_PROCESSING\n+ outbox(ProcessPayment)
ORC ->> PS : «command» ProcessPayment {saga_id, valor, paymentId}
deactivate ORC

activate PS
PS -> PS : dedup(message_id); INSERT payment(PENDING)
PS -> PG : POST /charges  (Idempotency-Key = paymentId)\n[Timeout · Retry · Circuit Breaker]
PG --> PS : 200 APPROVED {chargeId}
PS -> PS : <b>TX local</b>: payment → APPROVED + outbox(PaymentApproved)
PS ->> ORC : «reply» PaymentApproved {chargeId}
deactivate PS

activate ORC
ORC -> ORC : <b>TX local</b>: estado → ORDER_APPROVING (pivot cruzado)\n+ outbox(ApproveOrder, ConfirmStock)
ORC ->> OS : «command» ApproveOrder {orderId}
ORC ->> IS : «command» ConfirmStock {reservationId}
deactivate ORC

activate OS
OS -> OS : <b>TX local</b>: order → APPROVED + outbox(OrderApproved)
OS ->> ORC : «reply» OrderApproved
deactivate OS
activate IS
IS -> IS : <b>TX local</b>: reservation → CONFIRMED (baixa definitiva)
IS ->> ORC : «reply» StockConfirmed
deactivate IS

activate ORC
ORC -> ORC : <b>TX local</b>: estado → <b>COMPLETED</b>
deactivate ORC

note over C, PG
  <b>Notas</b>
  • "→" = síncrono (HTTP) · "→>" = assíncrono via broker (at-least-once), chave de partição = saga_id.
  • Toda mudança de estado + publicação ocorre numa única transação local (Transactional Outbox) – sem dual-write.
  • Todo consumidor é idempotente (tabela processed_messages na mesma TX do efeito de negócio).
  • Cliente observa o resultado final por polling em GET /orders/{id} ou webhook (consistência eventual).
end note
@enduml
